~ progress

Chicken Coop Owner: Ah... so you're the young farmer the Guide told me about.

Chicken Coop Owner: I've heard you've worked tirelessly to restore Harvestia.

Chicken Coop Owner: There is something important I'd like to ask you.

=> END


~ turn_in

Chicken Coop Owner: These chickens have been my family for many years.

Chicken Coop Owner: But time catches up with everyone.

Chicken Coop Owner: I can no longer care for this coop the way it deserves.

Chicken Coop Owner: I'd like you to become its new caretaker.

Chicken Coop Owner: The coop needs repairs before I can entrust it to you.

Chicken Coop Owner: Restoring the fences and feeding troughs will cost 500 Gold.

- I'll restore the coop.
    do GameDialogueManager.action_transfer_chicken_coop()

Chicken Coop Owner: Thank you.

Chicken Coop Owner: From this day forward, this coop is yours.

Chicken Coop Owner: Please take good care of my chickens.

=> END

- I need more time.
    Player: I'll come back when I'm ready.

=> END


~ completed

Chicken Coop Owner: Thank you.

Chicken Coop Owner: I know the chickens are in good hands.

=> END

~ level_too_low

Chicken Coop Owner: You've accomplished a lot for Harvestia.

Chicken Coop Owner: But caring for a coop is a great responsibility.

Chicken Coop Owner: Gain a little more experience, then come back to me.

=> END


~ not_enough_gold

Chicken Coop Owner: The coop still needs repairs before I can entrust it to you.

Chicken Coop Owner: Bring me 500 Gold, and we'll finish the restoration together.

=> END